*** OFFLINE PILOT-SMOKE -- PLACEHOLDER KEYS, NOT A REAL TOPOLOGY PROOF ***
Substituted dummy P-256 public keys because these were not set: TURNKEY_PAYER_API_PUBLIC_KEY, TWZRD_APPROVER_PUBLIC_KEY, TURNKEY_RECOVERY_API_PUBLIC_KEY.
This only proves the script runs end-to-end offline (CI parity). It does NOT
prove the real enrollment topology -- re-run with real values for that.

# TWZRD cosigner - Turnkey enrollment request

This creates a fresh child organization. Its three root users are customer hot
(payer), TWZRD veto (twzrd-guard), and customer recovery (payer-recovery).
rootQuorumThreshold=2: normal spend is hot + TWZRD; break-glass is hot +
recovery; TWZRD cannot move funds alone. A policy on an existing root signer
is not equivalent and is intentionally not emitted.

The recovery private key must never be available to the agent runtime (paper,
HSM, or a person's safe). Do not commit any private key.

Request body for createSubOrganization:

{
  "organizationId": "<PARENT_ORGANIZATION_ID>",
  "subOrganizationName": "TWZRD guarded payer",
  "rootUsers": [
    {
      "userName": "payer",
      "apiKeys": [
        {
          "apiKeyName": "payer-key",
          "publicKey": "02aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
          "curveType": "API_KEY_CURVE_P256"
        }
      ],
      "authenticators": [],
      "oauthProviders": []
    },
    {
      "userName": "twzrd-guard",
      "apiKeys": [
        {
          "apiKeyName": "twzrd-guard-key",
          "publicKey": "03bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb",
          "curveType": "API_KEY_CURVE_P256"
        }
      ],
      "authenticators": [],
      "oauthProviders": []
    },
    {
      "userName": "payer-recovery",
      "apiKeys": [
        {
          "apiKeyName": "payer-recovery-key",
          "publicKey": "02cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc",
          "curveType": "API_KEY_CURVE_P256"
        }
      ],
      "authenticators": [],
      "oauthProviders": []
    }
  ],
  "rootQuorumThreshold": 2,
  "wallet": {
    "walletName": "TWZRD guarded Solana wallet",
    "accounts": [
      {
        "curve": "CURVE_ED25519",
        "pathFormat": "PATH_FORMAT_BIP32",
        "path": "m/44'/501'/0'/0'",
        "addressFormat": "ADDRESS_FORMAT_SOLANA"
      }
    ]
  },
  "disableEmailRecovery": true,
  "disableEmailAuth": true,
  "disableSmsAuth": true,
  "disableOtpEmailAuth": true
